    11	`PASS` means the bundle passed the static checks below. Pack does not invoke the
    12	harness compiler, launch a model, execute skill scripts, run an agent or grade a
    13	patch. It does not guarantee full ADK schema compatibility, harness acceptance,
    14	model/adapter compatibility, runtime completion, patch production or test success.
    15	It does not determine whether prompts forbid editing tests, require scratch work
    16	in `/tmp`, or implement a fallback diff. Those require separate review and runtime
    17	evaluation. Harness limits and the nine-tool registry are a local snapshot derived
    18	from `data/raw/HARNESS_README.md` sections 2.3–2.4 and 6, not a live registry lookup.
    19	
    20	Pack requires `agent.yaml` and `eval_config.yaml` at the bundle root, and rejects
    21	alternative root agent filenames alongside `agent.yaml`. Every root, inline,
    22	referenced and standalone agent declaration must have a nonempty string `name`
    23	and explicitly declare the same allowed quantized Gemma model (31b, 12b, e4b or
    24	e2b). Supported classes are `LlmAgent` (default), `SequentialAgent`,
    25	`ParallelAgent` and `LoopAgent`. This repository's explicit-model rule also
    26	applies to workflow agents and is stricter than the harness's workflow schema.
    27	
    28	Tools must form a list of registry names, inline agent mappings, or
    29	`agent_tool: {config_path: ..., skip_summarization: ...}` references. Registry
    30	names are exactly `run_command`, `submit_patch`, `get_status`, `read_file`,
    31	`edit_file`, `write_file`, `get_code_neighbors`, `search_similar_code` and
    32	`get_code_subgraph`. Skills are an optional list of relative directory paths:
    33	absolute paths, null bytes and any `..` component are forbidden. Each directory
    34	must exist in the bundle, contain `SKILL.md`, and contain at most 50 MiB of files.
    35	Pack does not validate skill metadata or execute scripts.
    36	
    37	The inclusive structural ceilings are:
    38	
    39	| Check | Limit |
    40	| --- | --- |
    41	| Shipped files | 10,000 |
    42	| YAML files (`.yaml` and `.yml`) | 1,000 |
    43	| Each YAML / text include and cumulative include expansion per document | 50 MiB |
    44	| Combined `instruction` and `global_instruction` per agent | 1,000,000 characters |
    45	| Instruction characters across agent occurrences | 10,000,000 |
    46	| Each agent's `description` | 1,000,000 characters |
    47	| Agent occurrences | 500 |
    48	| Nested agent edges below a root (depth zero) | 50 |
    49	| Skill references across agent occurrences | 1,000 |
    50	| `LoopAgent.max_iterations` | Integer 1–500; default 500 |
    51	
    52	Repeated config references and aliases count separately when they create agent
    53	occurrences. Referenced agent documents are not counted again as standalone
    54	agents. Unreferenced agent documents are also validated and included in totals.
    55	Include expansion counts source UTF-8 bytes plus each transitive include's byte
    56	count on every occurrence, even when parsing uses a cache. The include recursion
    57	ceiling remains ten nested includes, separate from the agent depth limit.
    58	Instruction counts use decoded characters, including included text.
    59	
    60	`generate_content_config` must be a mapping or null. Its allowed fields are
    61	`temperature`, `top_p`, `top_k`, `max_output_tokens`, `presence_penalty`,
    62	`frequency_penalty`, `stop_sequences`, `response_mime_type`, `seed` and
    63	`thinking_config`. All other fields are rejected, including `http_options`,
    64	`tools`, `system_instruction`, `safety_settings` and `response_schema`.
    65	Pack checks integer `max_output_tokens` in 1–32,768, integer thinking budgets
    66	in 0–32,768, the documented thinking levels, and boolean `include_thoughts`.
    67	It does not validate the types/ranges of the other sampling fields or every
    68	other ADK agent field.
    69	
    70	The required `evaluation.max_time_minutes` must be positive, finite, and satisfy
    71	`max_time_minutes * 125 + 30 <= 660`. Optional `timeout_seconds`,
    72	`max_tool_calls` and `max_turns` must be positive integers when present
    73	(booleans are rejected). This arithmetic checks the repository's declared
    74	budget policy; it does not prove that the runtime enforces those budgets.
    75	
    76	`!include` paths resolve relative to the containing YAML file. `config_path`
    77	references resolve relative to the bundle root and must target YAML mappings.
