   221	    optional lifecycle position restrictions (:class:`CallbackType`). Retrieving a callback
   222	    via ``get()`` requires specifying the intended callback position to ensure safety and
   223	    prevent invalid callback usage. This specialized lookup requirement prevents reuse of the
   224	    generic :class:`Registry` base class.
